# Allowlist: exclude everything, then include only what the pipeline needs.
# This keeps local secrets (e.g. api_keys.py), caches, results and data out of the image.
*
!run.py
!utils.py
!metrics/
!README.md
!LICENSE
!description.md

# Never ship bytecode caches (they can contain values from local files).
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
